															<div class="game_description_snippet">
									Every chess move paints the board. SplaChess combines chess with ink-based territory control: win by checkmate or claim more squares when the board is fully painted. Choose from 20 characters and play against the CPU, locally with a friend, or online through Steam.								</div>
